  "title": "IPv4/v6: fix field offset calculation for GeoIP entries",
  "description": "Due to operator precedence this expression works correctly iff offset equals zero and FALSE equals zero, which they currently are. With offset first being added to isdst, before being evaluated for true of false, this expression would always return IPH_DST / IP6H_DST if offset was not equal to zero.\n\nThis change is suitable for back port. For master, a subsequent change could be made replacing gboolean with bool.",
